au3: add missing standard library includes

These files rely on transitive includes of the MSVC STL or libstdc++. Some
were already guarded with "#ifdef __linux__ // Linux requires explicit
include"; libc++ (clang64) needs them as well, so make them unconditional.
Statement.h and MultipartData.h use int64_t without <cstdint>, which
libstdc++ 16 no longer provides through <string>/<memory>.

